---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { business } from "../config/business";
const updated = "October 3, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms & Conditions | ${business.name}`}
  description={`The terms that apply when you use the ${business.name} website, request an estimate or book tree removal and tree care services in South Florida.`}
>
  <section class="bg-white py-section">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <Breadcrumbs tone="light" />
      <div class="prose-sf">
        <h1 class="text-h1 font-bold text-text ">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-text-muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
          These terms apply to your use of {business.url.replace("https://", "")} (the "website"), operated by{" "}{business.name}, an online service that connects property owners with independent local tree care professionals. We do not perform tree work ourselves. By using the website you agree to them.
        </p>

        <h2>Information on this website</h2>
        <p>
          The content on this website, including our guides about costs, permits and tree care, is general information.
          It is not legal, financial or professional advice for your specific situation. Local rules change; always
          confirm permit requirements with your city or county.
        </p>

        <h2>Estimates and services</h2>
        <p>
          Sending a form does not create a contract with {business.name}. Estimates come from the independent professionals who contact you; they are based on the information available at the time and become binding only when you and the professional agree on the work, price and schedule. The work is governed by that agreement between you and the professional, and {business.name} is not a party to it and is not responsible for the work.
        </p>

        <h2>Your submissions</h2>
        <p>
          When you send us a form, you confirm that the information is accurate and that you are allowed to share it. We pass it to the professional who answers your request and handle it as described in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          Do not misuse the website, for example by sending spam or automated submissions, trying to access systems you
          are not authorized to use, or interfering with how the website works.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The website's text, design and logo belong to {business.name} or are used with permission. Some photos are stock
          images used under their license. You may not copy or reuse the content without permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>We are not responsible for the content or practices of websites we link to.</p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          The website is provided "as is". To the extent permitted by law, {business.name} is not liable for losses
          arising from the use of the website or reliance on its general information.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms: send them through our <a href="/contact-us/">contact form</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
